  "@type": "Recipe",
  "name": "Smoked Haddock With Chive, Pea & Potato Crush",
  "text": "Smoked Haddock With Chive, Pea & Potato Crush\n\nPreparation time: 5 minutes\n\nCooking time: 20 minutes\n\nYield: 2\n\nIngredients\n\n300g small salad potatoes (halved),\n\n2 handfuls frozen peas,\n\n50g butter,\n\n2 smoked haddock fillets (about 150g each),\n\na splash white wine,\n\n½ small bunch chives (chopped).\n\nMethod\n\n1. Cook the potatoes until tender, then add the frozen peas for the last 2 minutes of cooking. Gently crush with half the butter.\n\n2. Heat the rest of the butter in a pan and cook the haddock for 3 minutes on each side. Remove the haddock then add a splash of wine or chicken stock and reduce a little. Stir in the chives.\n\n3. Put the potato on 2 plates, top with the haddock and the chive butter.",
  "prepTime": "PT5M",
  "cookTime": "PT20M",
  "recipeYield": "2",
  "recipeIngredient": [
    "300g small salad potatoes (halved),",
    "2 handfuls frozen peas,",
    "50g butter,",
    "2 smoked haddock fillets (about 150g each),",
    "a splash white wine,",
    "½ small bunch chives (chopped)."
  ],
  "recipeInstructions": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "1. Cook the potatoes until tender, then add the frozen peas for the last 2 minutes of cooking. Gently crush with half the butter."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "2. Heat the rest of the butter in a pan and cook the haddock for 3 minutes on each side. Remove the haddock then add a splash of wine or chicken stock and reduce a little. Stir in the chives."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "3. Put the potato on 2 plates, top with the haddock and the chive butter."
    }
  ]
